// ── Veld release-signing public key (PINNED) ───────────────────────────────
// ML-DSA-65 (1952-byte) public key whose OFFLINE private half signs every
// release manifest: SHA256SUMS.txt -> SHA256SUMS.txt.sig (the signed digest is
